## Tuning what people get

`PLANS` at the top of `src/index.js`:

```js
const PLANS = {
  free: { messages: 30,   label: "Free" },
  pro:  { messages: 1500, label: "Pro"  }
};
```

A "message" is one thing the user says in a scene, plus the coaching at the end.
Thirty is roughly six or seven full scenes.

**Set these before you launch, not after.** Lowering a cap on people who already
pay is a bad day.

### Which model runs the paid service

In `wrangler.toml`:

```toml
AI_PROVIDER = "groq"
AI_BASE_URL = "https://api.groq.com/openai/v1"
AI_MODEL    = "llama-3.3-70b-versatile"
```

`AI_PROVIDER` accepts `groq`, `openrouter`, `openai`, `anthropic`, `gemini`.
The first three share the OpenAI request shape; the other two have their own,
and the Worker handles all three shapes.

